bed rather than left as grouped holds: 442ball answered a keyless initialize 200 as 442ball 0.1.0 with 12 tools, forge-by-ui8 answered 401 with OAuth protected-resource metadata and fragments read and write scopes, paperjoy-01f7bf answered 401 on paperjoy.co/mcp behind 9 listed tools, eddyter stages a React editor into a codebase, and builders-in-fintech relisted and answered a keyless tools/list with 23 tools in 21,348 bytes where the guide recorded 19, so the guide count and FAQ were corrected in this commit. On /all, hologramxyz/avastudio-mcp answered 401 with 76 tool annotations in its listing snapshot and was held on the ad creative class carried by AdMake and Adspy, and perisclaw-mcp answered 401 and was held on the read-only messaging archive slice carried by Kaption WhatsApp. Counts for the supplement: guide tree 1,085 entries before and 1,086 after.